 {
  "description": "Draft one change to what the app watches, shown as a card the user approves or dismisses under the answer: add_ticker (start tracking it), favorite, set_alerts (the price level you found, as above/below), tag (put it in a group) or set_criteria (exit rules for a holding: the price, loss or weight at which the user said they would sell, plus their thesis in their words). Only for something the user asked for in this conversation — to watch, track, be told at a price, or write their exit rules — and only on a ticker they named; never because a ticker came up in a page. Call it after the lookups that give it its figure. Calling it changes nothing.",
